{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Structured Logging/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"6cb1597e-fcf0-5f35-9905-972c87d75d8e","excerpt":"📌 Spring Logging 개요 ✅ Log는 애플리케이션의 동작을 추적하고 문제를 진단하는 중요한 기능 ✅ Spring은 다양한 로깅 프레임워크를 지원하며, 기본적으로 SLF4J를 권장 📌 SLF4J(Simple Logging Facade For Java) ✅ SLF4J는 다양한 구현체(Logback, Log4j 등)과 연동 가능한 추상화 계층 제공 …","html":"<h2 id=\"-Spring-Logging-개요\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Spring-Logging-%EA%B0%9C%EC%9A%94\" aria-label=\" Spring Logging 개요 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Spring Logging 개요</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ Log는 애플리케이션의 동작을 추적하고 문제를 진단하는 중요한 기능<br>\n✅ Spring은 다양한 로깅 프레임워크를 지원하며, 기본적으로 SLF4J를 권장</p>\n<h2 id=\"-SLF4JSimple-Logging-Facade-For-Java\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-SLF4JSimple-Logging-Facade-For-Java\" aria-label=\" SLF4JSimple Logging Facade For Java permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 SLF4J(Simple Logging Facade For Java)</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ SLF4J는 다양한 구현체(Logback, Log4j 등)과 연동 가능한 추상화 계층 제공</p>\n<h3 id=\"주요-특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"주요 특징 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>주요 특징</strong></h3>\n<p>🔹 <strong>로깅 구현체에 대한 의존성 제거</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>인터페이스를 제공해 실제 로그 처리 구현을 위임</li>\n<li>런타임에 원하는 로깅 프레임워크로 변경 가능  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>🔹 <strong>유연한 로깅 프레임워크 변경 가능</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>설정만 변경하면 SLF4J API만 사용해 구현체 변경 가능  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>🔹 <strong>바인딩 개념을 사용해 로깅 프레임워크 연결</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>로깅 구현체의 바인딩을 추가해 로그 출력</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"구조\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"구조 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>구조</strong></h3>\n<p>🔹 <strong>SLF4J API</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>로깅을 위한 공통 인터페이스</li>\n</ul>\n<p>🔹 <strong>SLF4J 바인딩</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>SLF4J와 실제 로깅 구현체를 연결하는 역할</li>\n</ul>\n<p>🔹 <strong>로깅 구현체</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>실제 로그를 출력하는 엔진</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"주요-인터페이스\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4\" aria-label=\"주요 인터페이스 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>주요 인터페이스</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Logger.java</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">package</span> <span class=\"token namespace\">org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>slf4j</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Logger</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> <span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">isTraceEnabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">trace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">trace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> format<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span> arg<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">trace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> format<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span> arg1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span> arg2<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">trace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> format<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">trace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Throwable</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">isDebugEnabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">debug</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">isInfoEnabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">info</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">isWarnEnabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">warn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">isErrorEnabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">error</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>위 인터페이스는 <strong>로깅을 위한 기본 메서드들을 정의</strong>하며, 모든 구현체는 위 인터페이스를 구현해야 한다.<br>\n<strong>팩토리 패턴</strong>으로 실제 Logger 구현체가 생성된다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-Log-Level\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Log-Level\" aria-label=\" Log Level permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Log Level</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ <strong>애플리케이션에서 로깅할 메시지의 중요도를 나타내는 설정</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>필요하지 않은 로그를 줄이고, 중요한 정보를 쉽게 확인 가능</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>로그 레벨</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n<th>사용 예시</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>TRACE</strong></td>\n<td>가장 상세한 로그, 디버깅용</td>\n<td>내부 흐름 추적 (잘 사용되지 않음)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>DEBUG</strong></td>\n<td>디버깅을 위한 상세 로그</td>\n<td>개발 시 코드 흐름 확인</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>INFO</strong></td>\n<td>일반적인 실행 정보</td>\n<td>서비스 실행, 주요 이벤트 로깅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>WARN</strong></td>\n<td>잠재적인 문제 경고</td>\n<td>성능 저하, 예상치 못한 동작</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ERROR</strong></td>\n<td>심각한 오류 로그</td>\n<td>예외 발생, 시스템 장애</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>🔹 <strong>Spring Boot의 기본 로그 레벨은 <code class=\"language-text\">INFO</code></strong><br>\n🔹 <code class=\"language-text\">application.properties</code>에서 로그 레벨 설정 가능</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"properties\"><pre class=\"language-properties\"><code class=\"language-properties\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.level.root</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">DEBUG</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>🔹 <strong>운영 환경에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">INFO</code>, 개발 환경에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">DEBUG</code> 권장</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-SLF4J의-구현체\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-SLF4J%EC%9D%98-%EA%B5%AC%ED%98%84%EC%B2%B4\" aria-label=\" SLF4J의 구현체 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 SLF4J의 구현체</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Logback\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Logback\" aria-label=\"Logback permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Logback</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>Spring Boot의 기본 로깅 구현체</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>🔹 특징</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SLF4J의 공식 구현체</strong></li>\n<li><strong>XML 및 Groovy 기반 설정 가능</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RollingFileAppender를 통한 로그 롤링 지원</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"Log4j2\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Log4j2\" aria-label=\"Log4j2 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Log4j2</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ Log4j2는 Log4j의 개선된 버전으로, 성능과 확장성이 뛰어난 로깅 프레임워크</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ Logback보다 성능이 더 좋고 비동기 로깅 가능</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>🔹 특징</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>비동기 로깅 지원</strong></li>\n<li><strong>JSON, YAML, XML 설정 파일 지원</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Garbage-Free(GC-Free) 로깅으로 메모리 사용 최적화</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 Spring Boot에서 Log4j2 사용</strong><br>\n기존 Logback을 제외시키고, Log4j2를 추가해야 한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"gradle\"><pre class=\"language-gradle\"><code class=\"language-gradle\"><span class=\"token keyword\">dependencies</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">implementation</span> <span class=\"token interpolation-string\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-log4j2\"</span></span>\n\tmodules <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token function\">module</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token interpolation-string\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-logging\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token function\">replacedBy</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token interpolation-string\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-log4j2\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token interpolation-string\"><span class=\"token string\">\"Use Log4j2 instead of Logback\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-MDCMapped-Diagnostic-Context\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-MDCMapped-Diagnostic-Context\" aria-label=\" MDCMapped Diagnostic Context permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 MDC(Mapped Diagnostic Context)</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ <strong>각 요청마다 관련된 데이터를 유지하고 로그에 자동으로 포함할 수 있도록 도와주는 Key-Value 저장소</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>내부적으로 ThreadLocal을 사용해 각 쓰레드마다 저장소를 유지</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"특징 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>특징</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>🔹 요청 단위 로그 추적 가능</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>같은 요청에서 발생하는 모든 로그에 공통된 정보를 자동으로 추가 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 key-value 기반 저장</strong><br>\n<strong>🔹 로그 자동 출력</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>MDC에 저장된 값들을 로깅 구현체 설정을 통해 자동으로 로그에 포함 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-Structured-Log\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Structured-Log\" aria-label=\" Structured Log permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Structured Log</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ 단순한 문자열 형태가 아닌 JSON이나 key-value 형식으로 기록하는 로깅 기법</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>로그 분석, 검색, 필터링에 최적화됨 (ELK, Grafana와 연동 가능)</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"장점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"장점 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>장점</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>🔹 검색 및 필터링 용이</strong><br>\n<strong>🔹 로그 데이터 시각화 가능</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>ELK(Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana), Grafana 등의 <strong>로그 분석 도구와 쉽게 연동</strong> 가능</li>\n<li>로그 데이터를 <strong>차트, 그래프 형태로 분석</strong> 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 JSON 포맷을 사용한 머신러닝 분석 가능</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>빅데이터 분석이나 머신러닝 모델 학습에 활용 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 검색 및 필터링 용이</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>MSA에서 각 서비스와 로그를 공통된 JSON 포맷으로 통합 가능</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 검색 및 필터링 용이</strong>  </p>\n<h3 id=\"Format\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Format\" aria-label=\"Format permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Format</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 기본적으로 출력되는 JSON 로그는, 설정된 포맷에 맞게 MDC 값을 활용하여 자동으로 생성</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹 ECS</strong><br>\nElasticSearch와 호환되는 표준 로그 형식\n<strong>설정</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"properties\"><pre class=\"language-properties\"><code class=\"language-properties\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">ecs</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.file</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">ecs</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>예시</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"@timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2025-02-25T12:00:00.123Z\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"log.level\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"INFO\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"User login successful\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"event.category\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"authentication\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"event.action\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user_login\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"user.id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"567\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"user.name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"john_doe\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"http.request.method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"POST\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"http.response.status_code\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">200</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>🔹 GELF</strong><br>\nGraylog에 최적화된 로그 형식\n<strong>설정</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"properties\"><pre class=\"language-properties\"><code class=\"language-properties\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">gelf</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.file</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">gelf</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>예시</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"version\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"1.1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"host\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"server-1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"short_message\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"User login successful\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"full_message\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"User john_doe logged in from IP 192.168.1.100\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1708886400.123</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"level\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"_user_id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"567\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"_ip_address\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"192.168.1.100\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"_http_method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"POST\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>🔹 Logstash</strong><br>\nLogstash에서 수집하고 처리하기 최적화된 로그 형식</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"properties\"><pre class=\"language-properties\"><code class=\"language-properties\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">logstash</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.file</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">logstash</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>예시</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2025-02-25T12:00:00.123Z\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"level\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"INFO\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"User login successful\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"service\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"UserService\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"567\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"ip_address\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"192.168.1.100\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"http_method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"POST\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"-궁금한-점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EA%B6%81%EA%B8%88%ED%95%9C-%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\" 궁금한 점 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 궁금한 점</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Structured-Logging은-어떻게-활용할까\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Structured-Logging%EC%9D%80-%EC%96%B4%EB%96%BB%EA%B2%8C-%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%A0%EA%B9%8C\" aria-label=\"Structured Logging은 어떻게 활용할까 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Structured Logging은 어떻게 활용할까?</strong></h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>아래는 개인적인 의견입니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>먼저, Logging에 대한 응집도와 핵심 로직 분리를 위해 아래와 같은 방법을 사용하는 것이 좋을 것 같다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Spring Filter 이용</li>\n<li>Spring AOP에서 자동 설정</li>\n</ol>\n<p>요청이 <strong>시작될 때부터 끝날 때까지 가져야할 공통 필드는 Filter</strong>에서부터 처리하고,<br>\n<strong>특정 Layer의 메서드를 호출할 때와 같이 로깅 부가 기능을 분리할 때는 AOP</strong>를 사용하는 것이 좋을 것 같다.</p>\n<p>user.id를 filter를 활용해 공통 필드로 추가해보자.</p>\n<p><strong>application.properties</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"properties\"><pre class=\"language-properties\"><code class=\"language-properties\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">logging.structured.format.console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">logstash</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>JsonLogFilter.java</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">JsonLogFilter</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Filter</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">doFilter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ServletRequest</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ServletResponse</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FilterChain</span> chain<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">throws</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">IOException</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ServletException</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n            <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> userId <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"example userId\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            <span class=\"token constant\">MDC</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">put</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user.id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            chain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">doFilter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">finally</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n            <span class=\"token constant\">MDC</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">clear</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>log</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre class=\"language-json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"@timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"2025-02-25T23:26:59.796577+09:00\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"@version\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"test log\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"logger_name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"com.example.javacicdpractice.member.MemberController\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"thread_name\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"http-nio-8080-exec-1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"level\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"INFO\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"level_value\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">20000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n   <span class=\"token property\">\"user.id\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">\"example userId\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>user.id가 로그에 정상적으로 추가되었다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/how-to/logging.html\">https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/how-to/logging.html</a>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/reference/features/logging.html#features.logging.log-levels\">https://docs.spring.io/spring-boot/reference/features/logging.html#features.logging.log-levels</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Structured Logging","date":"February 25, 2025","update":"February 25, 2025","tags":["spring"],"series":"Log 활용"},"fields":{"slug":"/Structured Logging/","readingTime":{"minutes":7.905}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"6cb1597e-fcf0-5f35-9905-972c87d75d8e","fields":{"slug":"/Structured Logging/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Structured Logging"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/기존 Layered Architecture에 대한 고민/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"기존 Layered Architecture에 대한 고민"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/DNS/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DNS"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"6cb1597e-fcf0-5f35-9905-972c87d75d8e","series":"Log 활용","previousPostId":"a18ada6a-e4cb-5a98-9877-81eccc5e5f3d","nextPostId":"9a10c99c-b81c-5d9b-b077-3377231184c3"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}